 6006     16006 :  "You'll have to try harder than that to clear the Sugary Sweet Sticky Swamp Shootout Spyro! Mmm - try sayin' that six times. Come on, give it another try!"
 6007    0      :  "OK, I'll get em this time"
 6008    0      :  "No thanks, maybe later"
 6009     16009 :  "Great! Make sure to shoot ALL the targets before your honeycomb boat gets to the end of the course, or you'll lose! Shoot all the tanks, bees and grenade Riptocs. Don't worry, they are highly trained and extremely well paid professionals. Nobody will actually get hurt - well, almost nobody!"
 6010     16010 :  "Awesome shootin' Spyro! You sure you ain't my fifth cousin?"
